
# Step 1 — Create the Git repository

Inside your project folder:

```bash
git init
```

Check:

```bash
git status
```

---

# Step 2 — Create the GitHub repository

Go to GitHub

Click

```
New Repository
```

Example name

```
toast-rust-dashboard
```

Don't initialize with README.

---

# Step 3 — Connect local repo

GitHub will give you something like

```bash
git remote add origin https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/toast-rust-dashboard.git
```

Verify

```bash
git remote -v
```

